!! takes ~ files · grammar

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`files` params=`takes/host-paths needs/required seat/1 as/<file.mem…> ~ the carriers to read, every word past the verb`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`grammar` params=`~ apply the grammar-authority clauses, not only propose them`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

