!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ writes the named host files; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

